Warning: Jet.DisplayMigration: `MissingDisplay` has no `Display` impl; use the explicit debug selector for this interpolation.
  --> Tests/UILint/build_fn_liveness_root.jet:23:13
    |
 23 |     print("{value}")
    |             ^^^^^
 Why: Bare interpolation is moving to the explicit `Display` hook; the canonical migration edit keeps the value user-owned.
 Fix: Replace `value` with `{value:Debug}`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.DisplayMigration

Warning: Jet.UnusedPrivateFn: Private function `unused_helper` is never called or used as a value.
  --> Tests/UILint/build_fn_liveness_root.jet:18:5
    |
 18 |     unused_helper: fn() -> Int { 1 }
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A private function with no reachable reference is dead code; public functions stay exempt because other modules may use them.
 Fix: Remove the function, or rename `unused_helper` to `_unused_helper` when it is intentional.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.UnusedPrivateFn
